Z||000000||The Fieromaster||07-17-2001||12:27 AM||||*Insert 10,002 Crying "smileys" here!*<BR>I dont know what to do anymore... my baby will not start and i dont know what to do!  If your interested or care at all here is my story...<BR>We transplanted my Gt's engine (lets call this one gt-2) Into Fieromaster88's 88 coupe... the engine ran GREAT (i ask myself now wtf i was thinking) and i figured it would be cool for him to have a v6, 5 speed coupe!  So anyway in it went!  Then I took my extra engine from my first Fiero - 85 gt (we will call this one gt-1) that had a cam, head work, and only 3,000 miles on a BRAND NEW engine. Then i cleaned up my cradle added new mounts and slapped it in.  The engine from gt-1 had a problem that i transplanted... it had a manual fuel pump switch on it... cause one day it just stopped working and the relay wasnt the cause!  Oh well... anyway... gt-1 engine in gt-2.  I kept the gt-2 puter and all internals in it and the ONLY parts from the gt-1 was the engine and the engine harness!  So after i put it in, went to start... no go! Oh s=$hit! I must need to run a manual fuel pump switch again... And tanks to Don Yourk (THANK MAN YOU RULE!!!)  I knew what wires did what and what to connect to!  Well anyway turned on switch and the fuel pump built pressure then all the sudden just started sounding as if it was running free (under no pressure strain) well i didnt notice this at first and thought it was a timing problem (cause it would start for a second, actually 3 to be exact, then die imediate... instant die if you touched gas)... So i screwed with timing.. no go.. so then i realized what pump sounded like and dropped tank putin new pump and a piece of line rather than pulsator for $hits!  STILL NO START... I re-timed car with timing light... NO START!  So then i got in car with it off... put in key and turned it to run.. <BR>HEY NO CHECK ENGINE LIGHT!  I think that it is the computer, because as i remember it the light is supposed to come on before you start car!?!?!?!?  GRRR!!! going to get puter tomarow and try it... AHHH   If it dont im gonna cry!!!<P>------------------<BR>      "Raced That, Wrecked Better"<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.askfelons.com/fieromaster/fieromastergif1.gif">      <BR>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000<BR>AIM: Fieromaster<BR>1985 GT ~Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)<BR>1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX (AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000||||reg||8
